nding pair_config[1] == slippage for the LP execution with 1000 precision (1000 == 100%)_config[2] == deadline LP deadline for the UniswapV2 implementation","params":{"_amtPtknMintMin":"Amount of minimum pTKN that should be minted from provided underlying TKN","_config":"Extra config to apply when leveraging a position abi.encode(uint256,uint256,uint256)","_hasSelfLendingPairPod":"bool Advanced implementation parameter that determines whether or not the self lending pod's paired LP asset (fTKN) is podded as well","_pairedLpDesired":"Total amount of pairedLpTkn for the pod to use to add LP for the new position (including _userProvidedDebtAmt)","_pod":"The pod to leverage against for the position","_positionId":"The NFT ID of an existing position to add leverage to, or 0 if a new position should be created","_tknAmt":"Amount of underlying pod TKN to use to leverage against","_userProvidedDebtAmt":"Amt of borrow token a user will provide to reduce flash loan amount and ultimately borrowed position LTV"}},"borrowAssets(uint256,uint256,uint256,address)":{"params":{"_borrowAmt":"The amount of borrow token to borrow","_collateralAmt":"A collateral amount to deposit","_positionId":"The NFT ID for the position","_recipient":"Where the received assets should go"}},"callback(bytes)":{"params":{"_userData":"Config/info to unpack and extract individual pieces when adding/removing leverage, see addLeverage and removeLeverage"}},"constructor":{"custom:oz-upgrades-unsafe-allow":"constructor"},"initializePosition(address,address,bool)":{"params":{"_hasSelfLendingPairPod":"bool Advanced implementation parameter that determines whether or not the self lending pod's paired LP asset (fTKN) is podded as well","_pod":"The pod to leverage against for the new position","_recipient":"User to receive the position NFT"}},"owner()":{"details":"Returns the address of the current owner."},"removeLeverage(uint256,uint256,bytes)":{"details":"_config[0] == _collateralAssetRemoveAmt Amount of collateral asset to remove from the position_config[1] == _podAmtMin Minimum Amount of pTKN to receive on remove LP transaction (slippage)_config[2] == _pairedAssetAmtMin Minimum amount of pairedLpTkn to receive on remove LP transaction (slippage)_config[3] == _podPairedLiquidityPrice18 If we need to swap pTKN for pairedLpTkn to pay back flash loan, this is a 10**18*token1/token0 (decimals NOT removed) price of pod LP_config[4] == _userProvidedDebtAmt Amount of borrow token a user will use to transfer from their wallet to pay back flash loan","params":{"_borrowSharesAmt":"Amount of borrow shares to remove from the position by paying back","_positionId":"The NFT ID for the position","_remLevConfig":"Extra config required for removing leverage"}},"renounceOwnership()":{"details":"Leaves the contract without owner. It will not be possible to call `onlyOwner` functions. Can only be called by the current owner. NOTE: Renouncing ownership will leave the contract without an owner, thereby disabling any functionality that is only available to the owner."},"transferOwnership(address)":{"details":"Transfers ownership of the contract to a new account (`newOwner`). Can only be called by the current owner."},"withdrawAssets(uint256,address,address,uint256)":{"params":{"_amount":"How much to withdraw","_positionId":"The NFT ID for the position","_recipient":"Where the received assets should go","_token":"The token to withdraw assets from"}}},"version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"addLeverage(uint256,address,uint256,uint256,uint256,bool,bytes)":{"notice":"The ```addLeverage``` function adds leverage to a position (or creates a new one and adds leverage)"},"addLeverageFromTkn(uint256,address,uint256,uint256,uint256,uint256,bool,bytes)":{"notice":"The ```addLeverageFromTkn``` function adds leverage to a position (or creates a new one and adds leverage) using underlying pod's TKN"},"borrowAssets(uint256,uint256,uint256,address)":{"notice":"The ```borrowAssets``` function allows a